web/aurora/** -text

# Vendored PINNED drops — never line-ending-normalized. Both carry their own
# integrity check (web/vendor/hwb/PROVENANCE.md records the bridge's sha256;
# the chrome bundle ships MANIFEST.sha256), and autocrlf=true would rewrite
# LF files to CRLF on checkout, changing every hash and failing those checks on
# a fresh clone. Byte-identity is a commitment we made to the toolkit lane so
# their version pin stays meaningful — this is what enforces it.
web/vendor/hwb/** -text
web/assets/aurora/** -text
